 <P COM="0389">392.  <HI REND="ITALIC">Fabula.</HI>  Hic  <HI REND="ITALIC">fabulam</HI>  pro  <HI REND="ITALIC">parabola</HI>  acceptam
intelligo. Ven. Edit.,  <HI REND="ITALIC">jam quae Martini sapientia fluxerit
ore.</HI></P> 

